 R←Test_56(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms
⍝ `Process` called while no error is pending must not fail itself
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 parms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 parms.errorFolder←GetTempPath⊃⎕SI
 parms.(killThreads saveErrorWS createHTML saveCrash saveVars off)←0
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir parms.errorFolder
 ⎕SIGNAL 0                                           ⍝ Resets `⎕DMX`: its `DM` is empty now

 :Trap 3
     ##.HandleError.Process parms
 :Else
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1                                  ⍝ INDEX ERROR on the first line of an empty `DM`
 :EndTrap

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir parms.errorFolder
